DESCRIPTION:Theatre + Discourse · Berkeley\nhttps://ma.to/event/males-fil
 m-screening-20-nov-2026\n\nFree screening of MALÊS\, a historical drama 
 about the Malês revolt in Brazil in 1835\, held in celebration of Zumbi 
 Day and Brazilian Black Consciousness Month. Doors open at 7 PM. The even
 ing includes Tambores with Julio Remelexo and the film at 8 PM\, followed
  by a community discussion. Admission is free.
